      ],
      "text": "School failure, poor attendance, or new struggles:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " need investigation; often = an unrecognized learning disability, ADHD, or stressors such as family dysfunction and divorce, bullying at school, or depression in the child or parent."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
